load @term/seed/code/structure/set
  find set

# A transition system: the most general model of a process, a set of states with a relation saying which states can
# step to which. Automata, programs, and physical dynamics are all transition systems. The substrate is a transition
# system whose states are mesh configurations and whose step is the two-stage rule. The form carries the set of states;
# the transition relation is the dynamics.
form transition-system
  link states, like set
